    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Towards a Playground to Democratize Experimentation and Benchmarking of AI Agents for Network Troubleshooting
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+Z">Zhihao Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Cornacchia%2C+A">Alessandro Cornacchia</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Galante%2C+F">Franco Galante</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Centofanti%2C+C">Carlo Centofanti</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Sacco%2C+A">Alessio Sacco</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Jiang%2C+D">Dingde Jiang</a>
      
